  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now, when you create a \"Friends Only\" instance of a room, friends of anyone currently in the room are allowed to join. I would like to propose that this mode be renamed \"Friends-of-Friends\" and a new mode called \"Friends Only\" is created where only friends of the instance creator can join the instance.",
